# CRYPT3X /system/etc/hosts — telemetry and captive-portal sinks.
# Do not block the open web (no wildcard google.com). Do not block
# f-droid.org, proton.me, dns.quad9.net, pool.ntp.org, or github.com.
#
# 127.0.0.1 is used (not 0.0.0.0) so a lookup still resolves and fails
# closed on the loopback rather than waiting on NXDOMAIN.

